WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,280
two smoked fish

2
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:12,660
A small bag of salt. That's all for today's account.

3
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,940
These are for their business. As for you,

4
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,340
As long as you don't regret it

5
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,900
There will always be something for you to eat

6
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:25,290
I will come again in the future

7
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,200
I burned the words for you last night. I know, thank you.

8
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,570
Two fish and salt

9
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,820
Just this little thing

10
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:41,290
I just changed these after being there all night, otherwise what?

11
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:43,370
Do we have the right to bargain with him?

12
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,690
if you feel dissatisfied

13
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:46,250
You can go do the work by yourself, sister

14
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:47,330
It's smoked

15
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:55,260
You can tell at a glance whether it is smoked or smoked.

16
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:00,510
You didn't come back last night, Miss Chen

17
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:07,140
Divide out my share first and put the rest into the treasury first. We’ll talk about it tomorrow.
